<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - OPG 1996/97 NET DOWN NINE PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - OPG 1996/97 NET DOWN NINE PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    63.1  vs  69.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.90</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.47 vs   2.63</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    86.2  vs 111.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Pharmaceuticals wholesaler OPG Group previously said</p>
<p>it expected to post a 1996/97 full-year net profit of at least</p>
<p>60 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
